From: Sapphiren integration <local>
Subject: [PATCH] sapphiren: build isolated 4K AMP kernel variant

Set TOPAZ_4K for the dedicated 4K branch so CI can compile the existing
0140–0142/0952 page and AMP series without changing the 16K branch.

--- a/makedefs/MakeInc.def
+++ b/makedefs/MakeInc.def
@@ -16,6 +16,10 @@
 #
 SUPPORTED_KERNEL_CONFIGS = RELEASE DEVELOPMENT DEBUG PROFILE KASAN
 
+# Experimental sapphire AMP build: use 4 KiB pages and propagate the granule
+# choice to every recursive make, without changing the main 16 KiB branch.
+export TOPAZ_4K := 1
+
 
 #
 # Machine Configuration options
